# value 1, which is the chosen quality, so the riddle triggers; Bot1 takes "draw a card" and that mode is spent.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Gollum, Riddle Master
Swamp x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
